                "message": "Use the requested autokey pattern: name-year-title words with hyphens\n\nYear 4, hyphen separators, two title words (stretch 1) of at most\nfive letters; \"on\" joins the ignore list. Keys look like\nsmith-2017-atten-is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HNdCfPPQBnsznsDyobvCof",
